# The enquiry form's endpoint: the /exec URL of the Google Apps Script Web App
# that appends to the enquiries Sheet. See docs/enquiries-apps-script.gs for the
# script and the deployment steps.
#
# Set this in Netlify (Site configuration -> Environment variables) as well —
# this file is only a record of what the build expects, it is not read.
#
# Until it is set the contact form shows the email address instead of a submit
# path, rather than offering a button that cannot work.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
